<p>In 1883, Lanterman moved to Mandan after purchasing a lumberyard from {% person "frederick-hager" %}Frederick{% endperson %}, {% person "robert-hager" %}Robert{% endperson %}, and {% person "joseph-hager" %}Joseph Hager{% endperson %}, builders of the InterOcean Hotel. Albert joined him the following year. By 1906, the brothers were associated with {% person "w-b-haight" %}W. B. Haight{% endperson %} in the lumber and machinery business.</p>

