<p>Mandan leaders understood the economic stability a federal institution could provide. Many plants brought by Dakota settlers failed on the high prairie. Lanterman served with {% person "andrew-e-thorberg" %}A. E. Thorberg{% endperson %} and {% person "charles-lewis-c-l-timmerman" %}C. L. Timmerman{% endperson %} on a community committee that successfully lobbied Congress to establish the {% place "northern-great-plains-experiment-station" %}Northern Great Plains Research Laboratory{% endplace %} in Mandan in 1914.</p>

